# custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 申し訳ないでっすが、ここは一般の方の立ち入りは、<br>お控えいただいておりまっす。<br>すみやかに、お引き取りねがいまっす。
#. de: Du befindest dich auf einem privaten Grundstück. Wenn du hier nichts zu suchen hast, muss ich dich bitten, zu gehen.
#. fr: Vous êtes sur une propriété privée. Si vous n'avez rien à faire ici, je vais devoir vous demander de partir.
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_000:1"
msgid "Please be advised that this is private property. Unless you have pertinent business here, I must ask you to leave."
msgstr ""

#. ja: あ、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん！<br>おつかれさまです。<br>受付、異常なしでっす。
#. de: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Wie geht's dir? Hier ist alles bestens! ... Zumindest, was die Bücher angeht.
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Comment allez-vous<nbsp>? Tout va bien, ici<nbsp>! Enfin, en ce qui concerne les chiffres, du moins.
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_010:1"
msgid "<split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! How goes it? All's well here! ...At least on the bookkeeping front, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. ja: あうう、ご迷惑をおかけしまっした……。<br><split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さんの大活躍を<br>みなさんに知ってもらいたくて、ついペラペラっと……。
#. de: Manchen Leuten steigt der Ruhm zu Kopf, aber ich bin mir sicher, dass du auf dem Boden bleiben wirst.
#. fr: Certaines personnes prennent un peu la grosse tête, mais je suis persuadée que ce n'est pas votre cas.
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_020:1"
msgid "Some people let fame swell their heads, but I believe that yours will remain in proportion <i>and</i> firmly attached to your body!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あ、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん！<br>調査は順調でっすか？<br>砂の家に入られる新人さんの受付は順調でっす！
#. de: Guten <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Abend<else>Morgen</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Tag<else>Abend</if></if>, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>! Ich hoffe, deine Nach<shy>for<shy>schungen laufen zufriedenstellend!
#. fr: Bon<if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>soir<else>jour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>jour<else>soir</if></if>, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! J'espère que votre enquête avance<nbsp>?
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morrow</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 12 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morrow</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 4 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 11 < 17 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_030:1"
msgid "Good <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>evening<else>morrow</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>day<else>evening</if></if>, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! I trust your investigation is faring well!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: ふぅ～。<br>人が増えてきたので、名簿を整理してまっす。
#. de: \<seufz> In letzter Zeit sind hier so viele Leute, dass es ewig dauert, alle Auf<shy>zeich<shy>nun<shy>gen auf dem aktuellen Stand zu halten.
#. fr: (soupire)... Nous sommes de plus en plus nombreux ici. Je passe un temps fou à mettre à jour nos archives...
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_040:1"
msgid "\\<sigh> Our numbers have swelled so much of late, it takes an <i>age</i> to keep records up to date.<br>...Hee hee, that rhymes!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さんの名前には、<br>花丸をつけさせていただきまっした！<br>これからも、がんばってくださいでっす！
#. de: Oh, und ich hoffe, es macht dir nichts aus, aber ich war so frei, eine hübsche, kleine Blume neben deinen Namen zu malen. So kann ich dich schnell wiederfinden!
#. fr: Oh, j'espère que ça ne vous gêne pas, mais je me suis permise de dessiner une petite fleur à côté de votre nom pour vous retrouver plus vite.
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_041:1"
msgid "Oh, and I hope you don't mind, but I took the liberty of drawing a pretty little flower next to your name. This way I can find you quickly!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あっちもバタバタ、こっちもバタバタ……。<br>砂の家一番の大仕事でっす！<br>受付もがんばりまっす！
#. de: Das gesamte Hauptquartier ist in Aufruhr! Ich komme kaum hinterher mit allem, was hier so vor sich geht!
#. fr: Tout le monde a pris les armes ici. J'arrive à peine à suivre tout ce qui se passe !
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_050:1"
msgid "The entire headquarters is up in arms! I can scarce stay abreast of all the goings-on!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さんが助けてくれた時、<br>涙で前が見えまっせんでした……秘密でっすよ？
#. de: Als du zu unserer Rettung kamst, konnte ich kaum fünf Yalme weit sehen, wegen der Freudentränen in meinen Augen.<br>... Das bleibt aber unter uns!
#. fr: Lorsque vous avez volé à notre rescousse, j'ai versé des larmes de joie... Évidemment, gardez ça pour vous.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_060:1"
msgid "When you came to our rescue, I couldn't see five yalms ahead me for the tears of joy.<br>...I need not tell you that this is strictly for your ears only!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: あ、<split " " 1><string $gs1></split>さん！<br>ガレマール帝国との戦いは一段落したでっすけど、<br>ほかにも、まだまだ問題が山積みみたいでっす。
#. de: Die Bedrohung durch die Garlear mag gebannt sein, aber für uns gibt es hier immer viel zu tun.
#. fr: La menace garlemaldaise n'est peut-être plus aussi virulente, mais il y a toujours autant de travail pour les Héritiers.
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_070:1"
msgid "The Garlean threat may have abated, but there is no end to the work we Scions do."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これからも、よろしくお願いしまっす。<br>私もがんばりまっす！
#. de: Mögen wir alle auf unsere Art dazu beitragen, Eorzea zu einem besseren Ort zu machen!
#. fr: Puissions-nous tous faire en sorte que la lumière du cristal brille sur Éorzéa<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/001/RegWiltheWakingSands_00131:TEXT_REGWILTHEWAKINGSANDS_00131_TATARU_000_071:1"
msgid "In our own unique ways, may every one of us continue striving to make a better Eorzea!"
msgstr ""
